WEBVTT

NOTE Edited transcription of a historical recording. Unclear speech is marked; use current specifications for ordering.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.600
How to make a duplicate catalog.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:21.100
First, you'll access the resources website to
download the 2020 catalog.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:27.300
You'll see it's downloading here on my browser.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.800
Now I can access the Catalog Manager.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.000
Click Install.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.800
Locate my downloaded catalog.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:42.500
I'm going to load Shiloh B. Often I like to have
three catalogs so that I can have three

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:46.100
different finishes or door styles.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:54.800
WW Wood Products already is loading an A and a B
catalog.

00:00:54.800 --> 00:01:10.000
Now we'll click Rename and we'll locate the
catalog we need to change.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:16.400
So here you'll see Shiloh B. I need to change it
to C.

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:18.900
Now I'll install B again.

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:25.300
If I would try to install B without renaming,

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:28.800
the system would ask me if I wanted to override.

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:31.600
I do not want to delete the original.

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:33.700
Therefore, I just rename it.

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:43.600
Now I have all three catalogs, A, B, and C
available.

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:50.500
I can close my catalog manager, open 2020.

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:59.000
And this time, I will have all three catalogs in
2020, A, B,

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:03.300
and C. Thank you for watching.
